{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546232874,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","part":{"id":"prt_1d34a6e23002ST5Jm3GATatTrI","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","messageID":"msg_1d34a5926001OSZTNCy3rDzi77","type":"text","text":"Gate 2 resolved `sk-doc` as the owning skill (its compiled router defers on a plain document-wording edit, so the hub's authoring rules apply directly). Plan: three literal edits to the two named docs, then the two verify commands.","time":{"start":1794546232867,"end":1794546232874}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794546232933,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d34a6e26001p725k2PIh3rcNB","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","messageID":"msg_1d34a5926001OSZTNCy3rDzi77","type":"tool","id":"call_59cde944d3144da2a253c360","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml","oldString":"    - \"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and removed by default; kept, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given\"","newString":"    - \"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and replaced by a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer by default. Kept as it is, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given. Created as that pointer when it is absent and the run writes another file.\""},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n@@ -25,9 +25,9 @@\n mutation_boundaries:\n   read_only: false\n   allowed_targets:\n     - \"AGENTS.md, the root document: created when the repository has none, replaced with the shipped sections plus the composed block, and left alone when it already matches\"\n-    - \"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and removed by default; kept, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given\"\n+    - \"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and replaced by a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer by default. Kept as it is, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given. Created as that pointer when it is absent and the run writes another file.\"\n     - \".codex/AGENTS.md, folded into the block and removed\"\n     - \".cursor/rules/repo-local.md, the generated mirror of a non-empty block; removed when the block is empty\"\n     - \".cursor/rules/skill-routing.md, rewritten by its own generator, sync-gate1-pointers.cjs, which this engine calls and never composes a byte of\"\n     - \"REPO RULES.md, the router: shipped rows that are missing are appended and no other row is touched, and a missing file is created only behind --create-router\"\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"    - \\\"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and removed by default; kept, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given\\\"\",\"newString\":\"    - \\\"CLAUDE.md, folded into the block and replaced by a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer by default. Kept as it is, with its lines still moved into the block, when --keep-claude-md was given. Created as that pointer when it is absent and the run writes another file.\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794546232870,"end":1794546232933}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794546232939,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d34a6e25002bPiVooTD1SO3bH","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","messageID":"msg_1d34a5926001OSZTNCy3rDzi77","type":"tool","id":"call_29c3c010c4aa4c699f9c69b4","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md","oldString":"| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and remove it, which is the default |","newString":"| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and leave a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer in its place, which is the default |"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\n@@ -56,9 +56,9 @@\n | `--root <dir>` | `check`, `embed` | Classify or compose that repository instead of the one this command runs in |\n | `--dry-run` | `embed`, `restore` | Print the plan and the digest, ask nothing and write nothing |\n | `--plan-digest <digest>` | `embed` | The digest the plan printed; the apply refuses any bytes it does not match |\n | `--keep-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold a divergent `CLAUDE.md` into the block and keep the file |\n-| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and remove it, which is the default |\n+| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and leave a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer in its place, which is the default |\n | `--create-router` | `embed` | Create `REPO RULES.md` from the shipped rows when it is missing |\n | `--run <dir>` | `restore` | The backup directory one apply printed, whose `manifest.json` records what to put back |\n | `--yes` | `restore` | Take the confirmation as given, which the workflow passes only after its own yes |\n | `list`, `?`, `menu` | the command | Show the startup menu and the route manifest, and load no workflow |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\",\"oldString\":\"| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and remove it, which is the default |\",\"newString\":\"| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and leave a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer in its place, which is the default |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794546232869,"end":1794546232939}}}}
