{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794546248462,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d34aa848001CzkES2LxT5ElA8","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","messageID":"msg_1d34a9f26001TqWq46ZIWPEc3D","type":"tool","id":"call_3ad7c10bbc5943b68508a737","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -- .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"diff --git a/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md b/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\nindex 3b98198fa7..094a7943c7 100644\n--- a/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\n+++ b/.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\n@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@ Load the presentation contract before showing the menu, a plan, a digest, a resu\n | `--dry-run` | `embed`, `restore` | Print the plan and the digest, ask nothing and write nothing |\n | `--plan-digest <digest>` | `embed` | The digest the plan printed; the apply refuses any bytes it does not match |\n | `--keep-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold a divergent `CLAUDE.md` into the block and keep the file |\n-| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and remove it, which is the default |\n+| `--remove-claude-md` | `embed` | Fold it and leave a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer in its place, which is the default |\n | `--create-router` | `embed` | Create `REPO RULES.md` from the shipped rows when it is missing |\n | `--run <dir>` | `restore` | The backup directory one apply printed, whose `manifest.json` records what to put back |\n | `--yes` | `restore` | Take the confirmation as given, which the workflow passes only after its own yes |\ndiff --git a/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml b/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\nindex 5afbc85bfc..d53dde5c4a 100644\n--- a/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n+++ b/.ski