{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546260598,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","part":{"id":"prt_1d34ad0d600215C1xlqVMpCVac","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c199ffeiTQQulRLptPwQW","messageID":"msg_1d34ac814001W6kdf9wuIceFR8","type":"text","text":"T018 is implemented and verified. Three edits in the two named files, nothing else touched.\n\n**Files written**\n\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md` (line 60): the `--remove-claude-md` row now reads `Fold it and leave a one-line @AGENTS.md pointer in its place, which is the default`.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml` (line 29): the `CLAUDE.md` target now names the pointer default, the keep behaviour and the create-when-absent case.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml` (line 64): `keep_claude_md` now says `--remove-claude-md` folds the file and leaves a one-line `@AGENTS.md` pointer, which is the default (default false, so the pointer).\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`rg -c \"@AGENTS.md\" .skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml`\n\n```\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:2\n.skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md:1\nrg exit=0\n```\n\n`node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-agents-md-contract.test.cjs`\n\n```\nℹ tests 37\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 37\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 1054.602042\n```\n\n**Not done**\n\nNothing was left out. The checkbox at T018 in `tasks.md` is unticked, as instructed. No commit, no git state change beyond the working tree. The working tree holds only these three line changes across the two named files, confirmed by `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff` scoped to both paths. Nothing is blocked on the operator.","time":{"start":1794546258134,"end":1794546260598}}}
